helper script you write (the list is given to you; do not change the weights). Because one cell holds at most 40 numbers,\nspread the lookup over many cells (e.g. one output-letter cell per group of <=40 trie nodes) and add them with ops. Prefix detection must use ops on ctx rows (slice / mul / sum); letter probes are exact.\nAt most one trie node is active at a time (the anchored word-so-far), so node detectors are exclusive and the lookup is linear.",
